OL,3,GNEWSANew lakeside bereavement centre
OL,4,Aopens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new lakeside bereavement centre has
OL,7,Fopened at a former sand and gravel
OL,8,Fquarry.
OL,10,FThe Lake View Bereavement Centre in
OL,11,FMepal will provide facilities for
OL,12,Fpeople in East Cambridgeshire.
OL,14,FIt includes a multi-faith chapel
OL,15,Foverlooking a lake, a natural burial
OL,16,Fmeadow, memorial gardens, the Snowdrop
OL,17,FLodge for gatherings and wakes and a
OL,18,Frange of spaces.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
