OL,3,GNEWSANew lakeside bereavement centre
OL,4,Aopens
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarisa Rogers-Jones, bereavement centre
OL,7,Fmanager, said the facility was
OL,8,F"unique", adding that it "offers
OL,9,Ffamilies a peaceful place to remember,
OL,10,Freflect and feel supported, both now
OL,11,Fand for years to come".
